log":"Release 3.4 ties everything that was added with 1.21.5 nicely together! And yet again, I'm making it known that Geophilic's code is now on [**GitHub**](https://github.com/everloste/Geophilic).\n### Additions\n- Added sandstone boulders to the Desert\n- Added dry grass to the Beach biome\n- Added **Dunes**!\n  - Dunes are a new landscape feature found in the Desert\n  - They are made up of swaths of dry grass, dead bushes, flowers and cacti\n  - They also contain a significant amount of sandstone boulders\n### Changes\n- Dry grass can now generate in place of what used to only be dead bushes in the Desert\n- In addition to this, there is now more of this dry vegetation\n- Migrated the fallen tree feature from the block column type to the new fallen tree one\n  - Mushrooms as well as moss can generate on these fallen trees\n- Dark Forests now have an increased amount of leaf litter\n- Old Growth Birch Forests now get more wildflowers per wildflower\n### Changes since last Snap\n- Increased generation rates of leaf litters, wildflowers, and bushes in all relevant biomes","dependencies":[],"files":[{"filename":"Geophilic v3.4 f15-71.dp.zip","size":674916,"primary":true}]},{"id":"sytCq9nJ","name":"Snap 3.4-c (mod)","version_number":"3.4-c","version_type":"beta","game_versions":["1.20","1.20.1","1.20.2","1.20.3","1.20.4","1.20.5","1.20.6","1.21","1.21.1","1.21.2","1.21.3","1.21.4","1.21.5"],"loaders":["fabric","forge","neoforge","quilt"],"featured":false,"date_published":"2025-04-02T15:08:32.709724Z","downloads":5502,"changelog":"See datapack changelog below.","dependencies":[],"files":[{"filename":"Geophilic Snap 3.4-c f15-71.mod.jar","size":676844,"primary":true}]},{"id":"jOMpEpm4","name":"Snap 3.4-c (datapack)","version_number":"3.4-c","version_type":"beta","game_versions":["1.20","1.20.1","1.20.2","1.20.3","1.20.4","1.20.5","1.20.6","1.21","1.21.1","1.21.2","1.21.3","1.21.4","1.21.5"],"loaders":["datapack"],"featured":false,"date_published":"2025-04-02T15:07:59.277780Z","downloads":393,"changelog":"Geophilic version 3.4 is nearing release!  \nOn top of that, Geophilic's source is now available on [**GitHub**](https://github.com/everloste/Geophilic).\n### Changes\n- Migrated the fallen tree feature from the block column type to the new fallen tree one\n  - Unlike vanilla, mushrooms as well as moss can generate on these fallen trees\n- Dark Forests now have an increased amount of leaf litter\n- Old Growth Birch Forests get more wildflowers per wildflower","dependencies":[],"files":[{"filename":"Geophilic Snap 3.4-c f15-71.dp.zip","size":674877,"primary":true}]},{"id":"JdDHiPp9","name":"Snap 3.4-b (mod)","version_number":"3.4-b","version_type":"beta","game_versions":["1.20","1.20.1","1.20.2","1.20.3","1.20.4","1.20.5","1.20.6","1.21","1.21.1","1.21.2","1.21.3","1.21.4","1.21.5"],"loaders":["fabric","forge","neoforge","quilt"],"featured":false,"date_published":"2025-03-29T16:20:53.946993Z","downloads":14099,"changelog":"See datapack changelog below.","dependencies":[],"files":[{"filename":"Geophilic Snap 3.4-b f15-71.jar","size":670562,"primary":true}]},{"id":"R1qGyKCQ","name":"Snap 3.4-b (datapack)","version_number":"3.4-b","version_type":"beta","game_versions":["1.20","1.20.1","1.20.2","1.20.3","1.20.4","1.20.5","1.20.6","1.21","1.21.1","1.21.2","1.21.3","1.21.4","1.21.5"],"loaders":["datapack"],"featured":false,"date_published":"2025-03-29T16:20:13.120191Z","downloads":557,"changelog":"### Additions\n- A much requested feature: Added dry grass to the Beach biome\n\nThat's all. Have fun!","dependencies":[],"files":[{"filename":"Geophilic Snap 3.4-b f15-71.zip","size":668593,"primary":true}]},{"id":"7dpEShX0","name":"Snap 3.4-a (mod)","version_number":"3.4-a","version_type":"beta","game_versions":["1.20","1.20.1","1.20.2","1.20.3","1.20.4","1.20.5","1.20.6","1.21","1.21.1","1.21.2","1.21.3","1.21.4","1.21.5"],"loaders":["fabric","forge","neoforge","quilt"],"featured":false,"date_published":"2025-03-28T19:07:42.584039Z","downl